/ THIS 'FADC' FUNCTION HAS A 'SIGNAL-AVERAGING' OPTION:
/ IF YOU SPECIFY A SECOND ARGUMENT FADC WILL RETURN THE
/ AVERAGE OF THAT MANY READINGS ON THE CHANNEL SELECTED.

FADC,   FIXIT           /ADC FUNCTION FOR THE LAB8/E
        ADLM            /SELECT CHANNEL
        ADST            /START THE FIRST CONVERSION
        TSTCMA          /IS THERE A SECOND ARGUMENT?
        JMP ADC1        /NO

        PUSHJ           /GET REPETITION COUNT
            EVAL
        CIF P
        FENT
        FPUT FLAC
        FPUT FLOP
        FEXT
        NEGATE          /DO THIS IN DOUBLE PRECISION
        PUTFLAC
        FIXIT
        DCA OVER        /SO WE CAN DO 10,000 SAMPLES
        DCA LORD

ADC2,   CLL             /CLEAR FOR CARRY PROPAGATION
        DCA SIGN
        ADSK            /LOOP OVERLAPS A/D CONVERSION
        JMP .-1
        ADRB
        ADST            /START THE NEXT CONVERSION
        SDLD
        TAD LORD        /SUM LEAST SIGNIFICANT BITS
        DCA LORD
        SDRD
        SPA CLA
        CMA             /EXTEND THE SIGN BIT
        SZL
        IAC             /AND ADD IN THE CARRY
        TAD SIGN

        ISZ OVER        /DONE?
        JMP ADC2
        ISZ HORD
        JMP ADC2
        DCA HORD

        NORMALIZE       /EXPONENT= '27'
        CIF P
        FENT
        FDIV FLOP
        FPUT FLAC
        FEXT
        RETURN          /THE AVERAGED VALUE
/////
/////
/RELEVANT LAB8/E INSTRUCTIONS

        DISD=6052
        DILX=6053
        DILY=6054
        DIXY=6055

        ADLM=6531
        ADST=6532
        ADRB=6533
        ADSK=6534
        ADLE=6536

/ DK8-EP CLOCK INSTRUCTIONS:

CLCE=   6130    /CLEAR THE ENABLE REGISTER FROM 1'S IN THE AC
CLSK=   6131    /SKIP ON OVERFLOW OR AN ENABLED INPUT EVENT
CLSE=   6132    /SET THE ENABLE REGISTER FROM 1'S IN THE AC
CLAB=   6133    /AC -> CLOCK BUFFER, AC NOT CLEARED
CLEA=   6134    /CLEAR THE AC, READ THE ENABLE REGISTER
CLSA=   6135    /STATUS REGISTER .OR. AC; CLEAR EVENT FLAGS
CLBA=   6136    /CLEAR THE AC, READ THE CLOCK BUFFER
CLCA=   6137    /CLEAR THE AC, READ THE CLOCK COUNTER

